<title>USA: CFX Corp to buy back up to 150,000 shares.</title>
<headline>CFX Corp to buy back up to 150,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>KEENE, N.H. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFX Corp said on Wednesday that the company authorized the repurchase of up to 150,000 shares of common stock, or about 1.25 percent of those outstanding.</p>
<p>On August 31, the company had 12.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Any repurchases are dependent on market conditions. The company will use any shares acquired for employee stock purchase plans, stock option plans, dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plans.</p>
</text>
